WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.500
On Monday at work someone asks about your weekend. Finished actions use the past simple.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:21.300
Regular verbs add -ed: work → worked, play → played. Irregular verbs change: go → went, have → had, see → saw, buy → bought.

3
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:33.100
Yesterday I went to the cinema. Last night we had pizza. Questions and negatives use did, and the verb goes back to its base form.

4
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:39.500
Say three things you did yesterday and one thing you didn't do.
